  "name": "Cucumber Relish",
  "text": "Cucumber Relish\n\nYield: ¾ cup\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking Time:\n\nStatus: Very good.\n\nIngredients\n\n80 ml rice vinegar.\n\n125g sugar,\n\n1 small red chilli (seeded and chopped),\n\n1 tsp fish sauce,\n\n80g peanuts (lightly roasted and roughly chopped),\n\n1 cucumber (unpeeled, seeded, and finely diced).\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Put the vinegar and sugar into a small saucepan with 125 ml water and bring to the boil.\n\n2. Reduce heat and simmer for 5 minutes.\n\n3 Allow to cool before adding the chilli, fish sauce, and peanuts.",
  "recipeYield": "¾ cup",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "80 ml rice vinegar.",
    "125g sugar,",
    "1 small red chilli (seeded and chopped),",
    "1 tsp fish sauce,",
    "80g peanuts (lightly roasted and roughly chopped),",
    "1 cucumber (unpeeled, seeded, and finely diced)."
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Put the vinegar and sugar into a small saucepan with 125 ml water and bring to the boil."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Reduce heat and simmer for 5 minutes."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Allow to cool before adding the chilli, fish sauce, and peanuts."
    }
